    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25660" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διά-πτωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stumble, slip,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philem.
				60
			</span></i>; <i>error,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.215
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1251.5
			</span></i>; <i>failure,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίτευγμα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Po.</u>
				5.21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγάλοις δ. περιπίπτειν</span>
			fall in with great <i>losses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.32.55
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Olbia</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				364.62
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Ephesus</span>); <i>loss, deficiency</i>
			in accounts, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.52.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.</div>
